 * 
 * @section streaming_class_diag_summary Summary
 * 
 * Streaming class diagram shows class inheritance hierarchy, dependencies and associations of each unique
 * streaming class implementation.
 * 
 * All implementations of streaming classes utilize a universal stream control interface - ``RFStream``.
 * Each unique streaming class implements custom data gathering, processing and transmission procedures.
 * Streaming classes utilize the virtual DMA interface for high bandwidth data transfers and the
 * ``ISerialPort`` interface for device stream control and parameter configuration.
 * The implementations of virtual interfaces depends on the devices, that created the streaming object.
 * 
 * @subsection streaming_class_diag_legend Diagram legend
 * 
 * Link definitions:
 * 
 * - Solid line with a transparent arrow head body - Inheritance
 * - Dotted line with simple arrow head - Dependency
 * - Solid line with simple arrow head - Association
 * - Solid line with a hollow diamond - Aggregation
 *
 */